  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Registry checked November 2026"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">NSF Certified Protein Powder</Fragment>
      What NSF Certified for Sport actually tests, how it differs from Contents Certified and Informed Sport, and ten protein powders we found in the registry ourselves.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-answer">Quick Answer</a>
      <a href="#what-nsf-certified-for-sport-means">What the Seal Means</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Picks</a>
      <a href="#contents-certified-vs-sport">Contents Certified vs Sport</a>
      <a href="#nsf-vs-informed-sport">NSF vs Informed Sport and Choice</a>
      <a href="#how-to-verify">How to Verify</a>
      <a href="#who-needs-it">Who Needs Certification?</a>
