          </p>

          <p>
            More important than any single pick is the habit behind them. Certification is granted to specific products, and sometimes to specific flavors, so the brand name on the tub is not enough. Before buying, look up the exact product in the registry at nsfsport.com, and check that the NSF Certified for Sport mark is printed on the label. We explain how in the verification section below.
          </p>

