              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                A facility that is NSF GMP registered has passed a manufacturing audit. That does not mean any product made there has been tested. Look for the NSF Certified for Sport or Contents Certified mark on the product itself, and confirm it in the registry.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
