            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Forgetting to keep records</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Drug-tested athletes should keep the container, or at least photograph the label and lot number, of every supplement they use. If a test ever comes back positive, that record helps show what you took and where it came from.
              </p>
