          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            NSF Certified for Sport is the most complete certification a US protein powder can carry: verified contents, contaminant screening, audited manufacturing and banned-substance testing. NSF Contents Certified is a good quality mark without the anti-doping part, and GMP registration covers only the factory.
          </p>
